<title>FINLAND: Big in-house deal in Metsa-Serla.</title>
<headline>Big in-house deal in Metsa-Serla.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Finnish forestry group Metsa-Serla Oy was boosted by a 105 million markka in-house deal on Monday.</p>
<p>Evli traded in-house 2.5 million Metsa-Serla B-shares at 42.00 markka per share, up 1.00 markka or more than two percent.</p>
<p>Evli declined comment on the deal.  </p>
<p>No one at Metsa-Serla was immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
